{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52970","headline":"与郑辕薛晏游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 蒙泉 · 崔全素","name":"与郑辕薛晏游枋口同赋三韵诗（题拟） 蒙泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪转闻鸣泉，林疎渲苍藓。\n䔩洁来潺湲，凝光散清浅。\n未知适所从，空山漫流衍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔全素","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52970.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52970","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}